<h2>What to Do in the First Hour</h2>
<p>The steps you take before we arrive can save thousands of dollars in interior damage. In order of priority:</p>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><h3>Get people safe</h3><p>Keep everyone out of rooms with a sagging ceiling or water near outlets and light fixtures. If water is near electrical, turn off that circuit at the breaker only if you can reach the panel safely and dry.</p></li>
