    <tr><td>Temporary sealant or patch</td><td>Small punctures, open seams, flashing failures</td><td>Short term — until the permanent repair visit</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Membrane patch</td><td>Punctures and splits on flat commercial roofs</td><td>Short to medium term, depending on the membrane</td></tr>
